WEBVTT

00:05.839 --> 00:07.882
[theme music playing]

00:15.306 --> 00:16.850
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS

00:22.647 --> 00:24.649
[suspenseful music playing]

00:58.850 --> 00:59.684
[clang]

01:15.116 --> 01:16.326
[growling]

01:36.971 --> 01:38.264
[crowd clamoring]

01:38.348 --> 01:39.933
[woman] Take us with you!

01:41.101 --> 01:42.185
[crowd shouting]

01:43.603 --> 01:45.271
[crowd whimpering]

01:54.072 --> 01:55.824
Is there a ship for us, too?

02:01.246 --> 02:02.872
[approaching footsteps]

02:05.166 --> 02:06.918
What is that ship and who is on it?

02:07.794 --> 02:10.880
Military commanders
and high officials of Dongnae.

02:12.006 --> 02:13.550
They all left on that ship.

02:13.967 --> 02:15.718
They did not clean up the bodies.

02:15.802 --> 02:17.011
Once the sun sets...

02:18.805 --> 02:20.181
they will wake up again.

02:20.765 --> 02:21.933
[crowd murmuring]

02:23.852 --> 02:24.894
Is there another ship?

02:24.978 --> 02:28.314
They all burned down last night.
That was the only ship left.

02:28.773 --> 02:31.693
We must find a place for these people
to hide before the sun sets.

02:32.610 --> 02:34.362
What about the barracks
we were at last night?

02:34.445 --> 02:36.739
We can keep all these people safe there.

02:36.823 --> 02:40.994
Well, they tore down the fence
to repair that ship.

02:41.077 --> 02:42.120
[sighs]

02:43.496 --> 02:44.998
[Seo-bi] We can go to Jiyulheon.

02:45.456 --> 02:48.334
The infected were unable to get out
of there for several days,

02:49.252 --> 02:50.879
so they will not be able
to get in, either.

02:55.717 --> 02:58.469
We will go to Jiyulheon.
Anyone who can walk shall walk.

02:58.845 --> 03:01.181
The old and the sick will be carried
on wagons.

03:03.391 --> 03:06.269
Everyone, hurry! We will go to Jiyulheon!

03:08.021 --> 03:09.230
Move quickly!

03:09.314 --> 03:12.358
We must get there before the sun sets,
so please hurry!

03:19.949 --> 03:20.825
We shall go, too.

03:37.175 --> 03:38.218
[horse grunting]

03:38.301 --> 03:40.220
[indistinct chatter]

03:41.888 --> 03:43.389
Oh, no.

03:44.098 --> 03:44.933
[grunts]

03:45.391 --> 03:46.684
Are you hurt?

03:48.895 --> 03:50.855
- What is wrong?
- Over there.

03:50.939 --> 03:52.774
There is something weird over there.

03:53.524 --> 03:55.276
[man stutters] Wait, what is that?

03:55.360 --> 03:57.237
- [woman stammering]
- [man 2] What is that?

03:59.322 --> 04:00.573
[man 2] It is a monster!

04:03.326 --> 04:05.578
- There are monsters everywhere.
- There is one there too!

04:07.121 --> 04:08.248
[man 3] Over there, too.

04:09.749 --> 04:11.376
- Your Royal Highness.
- [man 3] Here is one!

04:12.043 --> 04:14.128
If we also consider the ones
hiding elsewhere,

04:14.212 --> 04:16.130
there will be a frightening number
of them.

04:23.972 --> 04:24.889
Run!

04:24.973 --> 04:26.724
Run! Now!

04:26.808 --> 04:27.642
[Mu-yeong] Run!

04:28.184 --> 04:31.104
- Run to Jiyulheon without stopping!
- [clamoring]

04:32.981 --> 04:34.565
[Mu-yeong] Run and do not stop!

04:34.649 --> 04:35.566
Hurry!

04:35.650 --> 04:37.485
- Get on this, sir.
- [Mu-yeong] Hurry!

04:42.573 --> 04:43.533
We must go.

04:45.034 --> 04:46.661
[crowd whimpering]

04:48.788 --> 04:49.789
Your Royal Highness!

04:53.042 --> 04:54.210
Help him!

04:55.461 --> 04:56.379
Push!

04:56.879 --> 04:57.714
Giddyap!

04:57.797 --> 04:58.965
- [grunting]
- Giddyap!

04:59.048 --> 05:00.383
[horse neighing]

05:00.466 --> 05:02.468
[panting]

05:08.433 --> 05:10.184
[crowd shouting]

05:16.816 --> 05:18.568
[panting]

05:28.828 --> 05:30.330
[panting]

05:32.165 --> 05:33.541
[Yeong-sin] Wait!

05:35.084 --> 05:36.461
Search the premises.

05:37.086 --> 05:38.713
Shut the gate once the sun sets!

05:39.172 --> 05:40.048
[man] Wait!

05:40.840 --> 05:43.176
[panting] Go inside.

06:04.197 --> 06:06.074
- [men shout]
- [horse whinnying]

06:09.410 --> 06:10.870
[whinnying]

06:15.583 --> 06:16.667
Your Royal Highness!

06:18.669 --> 06:19.837
Help them over there!

06:19.921 --> 06:21.672
Your Royal Highness! Are you okay?

06:23.007 --> 06:25.009
[grunting]

06:25.593 --> 06:26.803
[both grunting]

06:28.304 --> 06:29.472
[straining]

06:30.473 --> 06:31.474
[grunts]

06:34.977 --> 06:36.020
Your Royal Highness!

06:38.398 --> 06:39.732
You must go.

06:39.816 --> 06:41.150
They are starting to wake up.

06:47.407 --> 06:48.449
[gasps]

06:48.533 --> 06:50.493
[creatures shriek]

06:51.744 --> 06:52.787
Your Royal Highness.

06:53.704 --> 06:55.456
What are you doing? Push!

06:56.249 --> 06:58.793
Your Royal Highness, we do not have time.

06:58.876 --> 06:59.836
You must go!

06:59.919 --> 07:00.878
I am different!

07:01.379 --> 07:04.132
I am different from those
who abandoned these people,

07:04.215 --> 07:06.843
and I am different from those
of the Haewon Cho Clan!

07:06.926 --> 07:11.013
I will never abandon these people!

07:11.097 --> 07:12.890
[all grunting]

07:20.481 --> 07:21.649
[Mu-yeong] Get them on!

07:22.275 --> 07:24.277
- Hurry up!
- Hurry. Get on.

07:26.946 --> 07:28.114
[Chang] Hurry!

07:29.949 --> 07:31.868
[growling]

07:31.951 --> 07:32.827
Get on!

07:33.619 --> 07:35.371
[growling]

07:45.506 --> 07:46.549
Run!

07:46.632 --> 07:48.092
[both grunting]

08:08.404 --> 08:10.323
[snarling]

08:19.874 --> 08:21.501
[panting]

08:25.213 --> 08:26.214
[gasps]

08:34.889 --> 08:35.890
Where is the other wagon?

08:35.973 --> 08:36.933
I do not know!

08:41.270 --> 08:42.939
[panting]

08:55.117 --> 08:55.952
[grunts]

08:57.161 --> 08:58.746
[Yeong-sin] There is a monster ahead!

08:59.705 --> 09:00.665
[snarling]

09:02.291 --> 09:03.543
[snarling]

09:06.754 --> 09:07.797
Giddyap!

09:07.880 --> 09:08.714
[growls]

09:08.798 --> 09:10.466
- [grunts]
- [thud]

09:15.304 --> 09:16.681
[snarling]

09:17.723 --> 09:18.558
[gunshot]

09:22.603 --> 09:23.646
[growling]

09:24.814 --> 09:25.815
[snarling]

09:28.401 --> 09:29.902
[panting]

09:32.238 --> 09:33.781
[grunting]

09:44.875 --> 09:46.002
[creature growls]

09:48.671 --> 09:50.381
- [gunshot]
- [thud]

09:58.431 --> 09:59.515
[grunts]

10:01.892 --> 10:02.852
[gasps]

10:07.648 --> 10:10.151
- Prepare to close the gate!
- [man] They are coming!

10:12.737 --> 10:13.738
[gunshot]

10:22.371 --> 10:24.123
[growling]

10:27.710 --> 10:29.754
- [grunting]
- [gasps]

10:30.421 --> 10:31.380
[gun clicks]

10:32.214 --> 10:33.507
- [snarls]
- [gasps]

10:34.300 --> 10:35.384
[shouts]

10:36.010 --> 10:37.386
[panting]

10:39.680 --> 10:41.265
[Yeong-sin] Hurry! Run!

10:44.769 --> 10:47.021
Close the gate!

10:47.104 --> 10:48.314
[growling]

10:49.815 --> 10:50.816
[thumping]

10:54.278 --> 10:56.155
[panting]

11:02.036 --> 11:03.037
[pants]

11:04.789 --> 11:05.873
Are you all right?

11:07.124 --> 11:08.125
[sword rasps]

11:09.460 --> 11:11.504
Have the elderly and the children
hide in the shed,

11:11.921 --> 11:13.923
and anyone who can fight, grab a weapon!

11:14.006 --> 11:15.299
[crowd] Yes, Your Royal Highness!

11:21.514 --> 11:23.933
Come this way! This way.

11:36.487 --> 11:37.446
[spits]

11:41.033 --> 11:41.909
[spits]

11:43.786 --> 11:45.579
How long until we arrive in Sangju?

11:46.622 --> 11:51.377
Well, since the weather is nice,
we should arrive in two days.

11:52.378 --> 11:53.212
[spits]

11:53.295 --> 11:55.005
Are you sure it is safe there?

11:55.089 --> 11:55.965
[spits]

11:56.841 --> 12:00.094
Sangju is the second largest city
after Hanyang,

12:00.177 --> 12:02.471
and it is filled with soldiers
who will protect us.

12:02.555 --> 12:04.014
You need not worry.

12:04.098 --> 12:05.266
[laughs]

12:06.308 --> 12:07.393
[thumping]

12:08.728 --> 12:09.729
[thumping continues]

12:09.812 --> 12:10.980
What was that sound?

12:12.857 --> 12:14.984
- [creature growls]
- [chickens cluck]

12:16.777 --> 12:18.195
[thumping]

12:24.452 --> 12:25.453
My son.

12:26.203 --> 12:27.413
My precious son...

12:28.122 --> 12:29.081
My son...

12:29.165 --> 12:30.708
- [thumping]
- [growling]

12:33.836 --> 12:34.920
Hey, who...

12:35.671 --> 12:38.007
- Hey, shine the light over there.
- Okay.

12:47.933 --> 12:49.393
[Beom-pal] Is someone down there?

12:49.477 --> 12:50.770
- [growling]
- [screaming]

12:52.104 --> 12:54.523
[man] Monster! There is a monster!

12:56.609 --> 12:57.860
Help!

12:59.445 --> 13:01.739
- [screaming]
- [creature snarling]

13:04.158 --> 13:05.743
[snarling]

13:21.008 --> 13:23.010
[creature shrieking]

13:25.513 --> 13:27.223
[thumping]

13:34.897 --> 13:36.398
- [thump]
- [men gasp]

13:43.697 --> 13:44.573
[thump]

13:50.830 --> 13:52.164
[breathes sharply]

14:02.216 --> 14:04.134
[mast creaking]

14:29.743 --> 14:30.786
[relieved sigh]

14:36.584 --> 14:37.626
It is the sun.

14:39.295 --> 14:40.921
The sun is up, Your Royal Highness.

14:50.598 --> 14:52.516
[indistinct shouting]

14:58.355 --> 14:59.440
Your Royal Highness.

15:00.149 --> 15:01.609
The monsters are going away.

15:12.995 --> 15:14.288
They are all gone!

15:14.371 --> 15:15.497
[sighs]

15:17.499 --> 15:18.542
[sighs]

15:30.596 --> 15:33.140
They are all gone. You can come out.

15:35.059 --> 15:36.435
Seo-bi.

15:50.783 --> 15:54.244
[Mu-yeong] Your Royal Highness.
May I come in?

15:55.162 --> 15:56.163
[sighs]

15:58.624 --> 15:59.625
Come in.

15:59.708 --> 16:01.085
[door opens]

16:04.088 --> 16:05.923
I think you should come out.

16:20.104 --> 16:22.898
Thank you, Your Royal Highness.

16:22.982 --> 16:26.652
Thank you for saving us!

16:26.735 --> 16:29.113
[crowd] Thank you!

16:34.451 --> 16:35.536
[clears throat]

16:47.172 --> 16:50.467
Treat the wounds
and prepare some food to eat.

16:51.719 --> 16:52.886
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

17:00.686 --> 17:01.895
All done.

17:01.979 --> 17:02.938
[Deok-i giggles]

17:03.605 --> 17:04.815
Here.

17:07.151 --> 17:08.110
[grunts]

17:18.037 --> 17:21.623
- Do not use your right hand for a while.
- Okay. Thank you.

17:29.214 --> 17:31.175
Is that all there is
for the people to eat?

17:33.802 --> 17:36.221
Even that is difficult to obtain.

17:36.305 --> 17:39.266
It was hard enough with the war,
but they were taxed hard, too.

17:39.349 --> 17:40.893
How could they have anything to eat?

17:40.976 --> 17:43.520
I heard they ate anything living,
even insects.

17:48.650 --> 17:49.610
Your Royal Highness.

17:52.654 --> 17:54.031
Bring those children to me.

17:55.949 --> 17:56.992
Your Royal Highness.

18:01.663 --> 18:02.498
You kids!

18:03.499 --> 18:04.458
Come here.

18:06.126 --> 18:07.377
Get over here!

18:07.461 --> 18:08.545
[sighs]

18:14.635 --> 18:16.303
[sobbing] Your Royal Highness.

18:16.386 --> 18:21.141
We deserve to be killed for what we did.

18:21.225 --> 18:23.477
[Deok-i crying]

18:26.814 --> 18:27.731
[sniffs]

18:33.153 --> 18:35.197
What is this?

18:35.280 --> 18:36.490
It is food.

18:43.080 --> 18:44.248
[sniffs]

18:52.256 --> 18:53.257
Now, go on and play.

18:58.720 --> 18:59.888
[sighs]

19:02.516 --> 19:03.600
Give this to them.

19:05.144 --> 19:06.854
- Your Royal Highness.
- I am fine.

19:06.937 --> 19:08.313
I am sick of it anyway.

19:15.696 --> 19:17.656
[Mu-yeong] Everyone, gather round.

19:17.739 --> 19:18.824
Gather round.

19:20.325 --> 19:22.202
This is from the Crown Prince.

19:22.786 --> 19:23.954
What is this?

19:24.705 --> 19:25.998
It is meat.

19:26.081 --> 19:28.333
- Meat? This is meat?
- Meat?

19:28.417 --> 19:29.459
This is meat!

19:29.543 --> 19:31.378
Thank you, Your Royal Highness.

19:32.045 --> 19:34.131
- [man] It is meat!
- [man 2] It really is meat.

19:34.214 --> 19:35.799
How do we eat this?

19:35.883 --> 19:38.594
- [man 2] Make some soup with this.
- [man 3] Is this really meat?

19:50.689 --> 19:52.149
[people exclaiming]

19:53.066 --> 19:56.528
[man 4] Wow! Look! It got bigger!

20:05.579 --> 20:07.080
They are happy with the food.

20:09.333 --> 20:10.667
What will you do now?

20:10.751 --> 20:12.794
I will go to Lord Ahn Hyeon in Sangju.

20:21.178 --> 20:22.054
What is it?

20:22.137 --> 20:23.388
I am from Sangju.

20:24.598 --> 20:27.768
If you wish to go to Sangju,
I will be your guide.

20:28.727 --> 20:29.811
How can we trust you?

20:30.729 --> 20:32.022
Who are you, exactly?

20:33.690 --> 20:35.025
I am merely one of the people.

20:35.442 --> 20:38.028
Then how do you know how to shoot a gun?

20:40.322 --> 20:42.032
I learned while serving during the war.

20:42.115 --> 20:45.202
You shot a monster right in the forehead
as it charged at you.

20:46.870 --> 20:49.164
Your skills are better than most soldiers.

20:50.540 --> 20:51.625
Who are you?

20:54.795 --> 20:56.046
[thump at door]

21:02.469 --> 21:03.428
[thump]

21:06.473 --> 21:07.599
[thump]

21:09.518 --> 21:12.104
[thumps continue]

21:12.187 --> 21:14.189
[crowd murmuring]

21:15.274 --> 21:17.734
What is going on? Are they the ones
who attacked us yesterday?

21:18.151 --> 21:20.195
- [man 5] What do we do?
- [man 6] It must be them!

21:23.115 --> 21:24.366
[thumping continues]

21:24.449 --> 21:28.829
[guard] Traitor Lee Chang,
the Crown Prince, must hear this!

21:31.832 --> 21:35.294
"The criminal, who must be transferred
to Hanyang for investigation,

21:36.253 --> 21:40.841
defied the King's command
and killed the commander of the Royal Army

21:40.924 --> 21:42.426
who came to arrest him.

21:43.135 --> 21:44.011
This crime...

21:44.761 --> 21:48.807
committed by the Crown Prince,
who must uphold the nation's laws,

21:48.890 --> 21:52.519
is an unforgivable act of treason!

21:54.104 --> 21:56.231
The traitor who defied the King's command

21:56.690 --> 22:00.360
must come out voluntarily and be bound!

22:02.029 --> 22:04.698
If you do not come out voluntarily
right this instant,

22:05.574 --> 22:08.410
it will be considered another defiance
against the King's command,

22:08.493 --> 22:11.538
and thus, you will be punished
severely by the law."

22:11.621 --> 22:12.956
What is he talking about?

22:13.040 --> 22:15.167
[woman] Did they just say he is a traitor?

22:15.584 --> 22:18.795
They must be seriously mistaken.

22:18.879 --> 22:22.758
- Right.
- You should go and talk to them.

22:24.593 --> 22:26.511
Your Royal Highness, let me handle it.

22:27.971 --> 22:31.058
Chief! I, the Crown Prince's guard,
will come out!

22:49.910 --> 22:50.952
[sobs]

22:51.870 --> 22:53.413
Your Majesty's son...

22:56.750 --> 22:58.377
killed my son.

22:59.920 --> 23:01.963
I will do the same to him.

23:04.966 --> 23:06.009
No.

23:07.344 --> 23:09.137
I will be merciless

23:11.515 --> 23:13.183
and kill him brutally.

23:16.103 --> 23:16.937
[grunts]

23:17.020 --> 23:18.105
[screaming]

23:25.695 --> 23:27.030
Your Royal Highness!

23:30.409 --> 23:32.160
[crowd clamoring]

23:42.546 --> 23:43.547
[grunts]

23:44.840 --> 23:46.133
[groaning]

23:48.927 --> 23:51.888
Your Royal Highness! It is dangerous! Run!

23:53.098 --> 23:54.307
Your Royal Highness!

23:55.392 --> 23:58.103
You must flee! Your Royal Highness!

23:58.186 --> 24:00.188
[somber music playing]

24:05.610 --> 24:06.903
[screaming]

24:13.994 --> 24:16.121
Your Royal Highness. Are you okay?

24:16.204 --> 24:17.914
[panting]

24:25.589 --> 24:26.923
It is my fault.

24:27.716 --> 24:29.551
- Because of me...
- [Yeong-sin] That is correct.

24:29.634 --> 24:31.511
- This is all because of you.
- Shut up!

24:31.595 --> 24:33.889
If we are to survive, you must step up!

24:33.972 --> 24:36.808
- Shut up!
- Otherwise, we will all die!

24:44.649 --> 24:45.859
[crowd gasps]

25:39.538 --> 25:40.956
- [gunshot]
- [groans]

25:41.039 --> 25:42.582
They have a gun!

25:55.929 --> 25:57.138
- [gunshot]
- [groans]

26:02.394 --> 26:03.979
Gun squad, come with me.

26:04.854 --> 26:06.314
The rest of you, stand guard.

26:18.159 --> 26:19.452
They have one gun.

26:20.412 --> 26:22.205
- Have them march in.
- Yes, sir.

26:23.582 --> 26:24.749
[whistles]

26:32.465 --> 26:33.466
[gunshot]

26:34.509 --> 26:35.635
[whistles]

27:29.481 --> 27:30.899
[distant whistle]

27:31.399 --> 27:32.692
It is coming from the entrance.

27:38.073 --> 27:39.115
Search the area!

27:39.616 --> 27:40.700
He has been shot.

27:42.494 --> 27:43.620
[whistle]

27:44.704 --> 27:45.872
That way!

27:48.083 --> 27:49.918
[ominous music playing]

28:03.014 --> 28:04.099
[guard shouts]

28:04.182 --> 28:05.100
[grunts]

28:06.476 --> 28:07.519
[sword rasps]

28:19.948 --> 28:21.074
- [Seo-bi yells]
- [groans]

28:25.870 --> 28:26.788
[grunts]

28:31.793 --> 28:33.628
Now! Come on out!

28:34.254 --> 28:35.672
[indistinct chatter]

28:36.756 --> 28:38.299
It is dangerous for you to stay with us.

28:38.383 --> 28:40.802
Go to Yangsan before the sun sets. Hurry!

28:55.191 --> 28:56.151
[sighs]

29:24.637 --> 29:26.347
[panting]

29:44.240 --> 29:46.409
[whistles]

29:46.493 --> 29:47.577
To the south.

29:50.789 --> 29:52.499
[whistles]

29:55.418 --> 29:56.711
[whistles]

29:56.795 --> 29:57.796
To the west!

29:59.380 --> 30:00.256
[whistles]

30:07.764 --> 30:09.307
[whistles]

30:18.399 --> 30:19.400
We were fooled.

30:22.487 --> 30:23.780
It was the Crown Prince's guard.

30:24.572 --> 30:27.325
He knew our signals and led us astray.

30:41.506 --> 30:43.132
[panting]

30:46.803 --> 30:48.680
[guard] Bring the horses.
We must chase them.

30:48.763 --> 30:49.848
It is too late.

30:51.140 --> 30:52.600
No need to rush.

30:52.684 --> 30:54.185
Will you not chase after them?

30:55.728 --> 30:56.855
There is no need.

30:58.189 --> 31:00.400
I know where they are heading to.

31:08.032 --> 31:10.285
SANGJU, AHN HYEON

31:18.543 --> 31:19.794
- Report it.
- Yes, sir.

31:21.629 --> 31:22.797
The signal fire has been lit!

31:25.550 --> 31:28.636
HANYANG

31:31.264 --> 31:33.308
[panting] The signal fire...

31:33.391 --> 31:34.809
The signal fire has been lit.

31:38.479 --> 31:41.691
I heard that the signal fire has been lit.
Is there going to be a war?

31:41.774 --> 31:43.359
Did Japan invade again?

31:43.443 --> 31:45.570
Nothing has been confirmed yet.

31:45.653 --> 31:47.322
We must gather the troops.

31:47.405 --> 31:50.283
We must act before they march into Hanyang
like last time.

31:50.658 --> 31:52.285
I must see His Majesty.

31:53.828 --> 31:55.371
What do you mean?

31:55.455 --> 31:58.374
The signal fire is burning high
up on Cheoncheonryeong.

31:58.458 --> 32:00.209
Our nation is in peril.

32:00.752 --> 32:04.255
We cannot waste a single second.
I shall go to the King's palace.

32:05.381 --> 32:06.299
But...

32:07.425 --> 32:09.135
I agree with Chief Scholar.

32:09.218 --> 32:10.970
I must see His Majesty as well.

32:11.054 --> 32:12.263
But...

32:12.347 --> 32:13.890
Minister, where are you going?

32:13.973 --> 32:15.516
He is going to the King's palace.

32:15.600 --> 32:17.310
- The King's palace?
- Yes.

32:18.728 --> 32:21.189
My lord, wait for us.

32:28.947 --> 32:29.822
Step aside.

32:30.281 --> 32:31.950
I must speak with His Majesty.

32:32.033 --> 32:34.202
We were ordered not to let outsiders in.

32:34.619 --> 32:35.745
How dare you!

32:36.162 --> 32:38.289
Do you not know who we are?

32:39.958 --> 32:41.084
Step back!

32:41.709 --> 32:44.379
How dare you draw your sword at us?

32:44.837 --> 32:46.172
Step aside!

32:46.756 --> 32:47.882
How dare you!

32:48.841 --> 32:50.927
[Hak-ju]
Are you that desperate to see His Majesty?

32:51.010 --> 32:53.972
My lord, I tried to stop them.

32:54.472 --> 32:55.848
You should see His Majesty.

32:55.932 --> 32:59.477
You all are core officials
who lead this nation.

32:59.560 --> 33:00.728
Step aside.

33:02.271 --> 33:04.440
Let us go see His Majesty together.

33:10.154 --> 33:10.989
[clears throat]

33:38.975 --> 33:40.685
[woman] What do you think you are doing?

33:45.273 --> 33:48.609
Your Majesty,
the signal fire has been lit.

33:49.068 --> 33:51.571
We must see His Majesty
and fix the situation.

33:51.654 --> 33:53.614
Please withdraw your command.

33:57.035 --> 33:58.619
Even if it is an emergency,

33:58.703 --> 34:01.622
how could you barge in like this
when His Majesty is gravely ill?

34:02.790 --> 34:04.083
Please step aside.

34:05.835 --> 34:08.671
We cannot hide
His Majesty's illness any longer.

34:08.755 --> 34:09.756
Father!

34:12.550 --> 34:14.260
Why are you doing this?

34:15.970 --> 34:17.263
We shall go inside.

34:17.764 --> 34:19.182
What are you doing?

34:19.265 --> 34:21.100
Show them out!

34:24.937 --> 34:25.938
Step aside.

34:29.901 --> 34:30.902
Announce us.

34:35.531 --> 34:38.451
Your Majesty, Chief State Councillor
is here to see you.

34:41.245 --> 34:43.956
The sun will set soon.

35:13.653 --> 35:17.073
I think His Majesty is asleep.

35:22.245 --> 35:25.373
His Majesty will wake up soon.
Have a seat.

35:30.753 --> 35:31.838
Come this way.

35:33.548 --> 35:37.135
You have not seen him in a while.
You should see him up close.

35:44.267 --> 35:45.143
Raise the blinds.

36:04.954 --> 36:09.000
Do you know why the signal fire
has been lit from the south?

36:09.792 --> 36:11.919
It is neither due to an invasion
nor a war.

36:12.962 --> 36:14.881
A disease has spread.

36:15.506 --> 36:17.717
It is a frightening disease
that makes one sleep

36:17.800 --> 36:20.845
when the sun rises and crave
the flesh and blood of living people

36:21.679 --> 36:23.556
when the sun sets.

36:52.585 --> 36:54.003
[distant snarling]

36:56.547 --> 36:58.007
[chain clangs]

36:58.799 --> 37:00.468
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

37:00.551 --> 37:04.639
- Please be healthy and live a long life!
- Please be healthy and live a long life!

37:09.518 --> 37:11.270
[king snarls]

37:12.855 --> 37:14.815
[snarling]

37:15.566 --> 37:16.817
[growling]

37:16.901 --> 37:18.277
[screaming]

37:25.743 --> 37:28.079
[snarling]

37:28.162 --> 37:29.580
Look carefully.

37:31.040 --> 37:32.750
This is the King of Joseon,

37:32.833 --> 37:35.878
the father of the tens of thousands
of subjects of the land.

37:36.837 --> 37:38.005
[snarling]

37:39.173 --> 37:41.884
Is this why a court lady's corpse
has been carried out every day?

37:41.968 --> 37:43.761
Is it all because of this disease?

37:44.345 --> 37:45.513
What if I say it is?

37:46.681 --> 37:49.725
If he lost his mind due to an illness
and craved human flesh,

37:50.309 --> 37:51.769
is he no longer the King?

37:52.812 --> 37:56.065
If he is not the King, who is he?

37:56.148 --> 37:58.276
- [chain clangs]
- He is alive, as you can see.

37:58.359 --> 38:00.736
Do you deny that he is the King?

38:02.446 --> 38:04.156
[king snarling]

38:04.240 --> 38:06.826
Is that why you lured
the Crown Prince and scholars

38:07.994 --> 38:09.954
and schemed rebellion

38:11.372 --> 38:13.291
to steal the King's throne?

38:16.794 --> 38:18.546
Lord Cho, what do you...

38:22.425 --> 38:25.511
Although His Majesty
contracted a grave disease,

38:26.929 --> 38:28.806
he is still the King of Joseon

38:28.889 --> 38:31.183
and the lord of the people.

38:31.267 --> 38:32.226
[snarls]

38:32.310 --> 38:35.438
For rebelling against His Majesty
and coveting the throne,

38:35.521 --> 38:37.189
your family should be annihilated.

38:37.273 --> 38:40.359
Arrest Chief Scholar Kim Sun immediately
and behead him.

38:40.443 --> 38:42.862
As for Crown Prince Lee Chang,
who fled to the south,

38:43.487 --> 38:45.031
he shall be deposed

38:46.073 --> 38:48.451
and poisoned to death.

38:50.911 --> 38:54.373
Palace guards, take the criminal Kim Sun
to the Royal Investigation Bureau!

39:11.140 --> 39:12.683
[king growls]

39:23.402 --> 39:24.487
[snarls]

39:46.092 --> 39:50.096
[official] We will begin Chief Scholar
Kim Sun's interrogation!

39:57.978 --> 39:59.688
When did you plan all of this?

40:02.817 --> 40:06.737
You should have discussed it with me
if you planned to do something like this.

40:10.199 --> 40:11.909
I may be your daughter,

40:12.910 --> 40:14.829
but I am also the mother of this nation.

40:29.802 --> 40:31.429
I will kill them all.

40:32.346 --> 40:33.681
Every single one of them.

40:36.267 --> 40:40.104
I will kill the Crown Prince, who killed
my son, and everyone who follows him

40:42.690 --> 40:44.358
without any mercy.

40:45.192 --> 40:47.111
I will not forgive anyone

40:48.237 --> 40:49.947
who gets in my way.

40:51.991 --> 40:52.950
So,

40:54.827 --> 40:56.412
do not dare to stop me...

40:57.538 --> 40:58.873
ever again.

41:01.500 --> 41:03.711
I did not put you where you are now

41:06.005 --> 41:08.299
so that you can get in my way.

41:12.011 --> 41:13.429
Give birth to a son.

41:15.347 --> 41:17.183
It has to be a son.

41:19.518 --> 41:21.687
That is what you must do.

41:23.314 --> 41:24.648
Do not worry, Father.

41:25.357 --> 41:28.402
I will give birth to a son

41:29.320 --> 41:31.780
who will succeed Beom-il
in the Haewon Cho Clan...

41:35.242 --> 41:37.119
and inherit the throne.

41:53.093 --> 41:55.095
[theme music playing]
